wh40k-footfall-ambient-marisveyraworker-line-1 = Keep your copy. The stamp is never where you left it.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-marisveyraworker-line-2 = Yes, another form. No, I did not invent this one.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-marisveyraworker-line-3 = Maris remembers faces. I remember the queue.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-marisveyraworker-line-4 = Need a contract? Maris handles those; I only file the paperwork.

wh40k-footfall-ambient-hestvarnworker-line-1 = Check the label before you lift it. Your back will thank you.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-hestvarnworker-line-2 = Someone has written fragile on an ore crate again.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-hestvarnworker-line-3 = We are behind schedule, but the cargo is still here.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-hestvarnworker-line-4 = Buying supplies? Hest is at the counter.

wh40k-footfall-ambient-avelinequillworker-line-1 = A quiet chart is a good chart. Usually.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-avelinequillworker-line-2 = I keep a second route plotted. It helps me sleep.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-avelinequillworker-line-3 = That line on the chart is a warning, not a shortcut.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-avelinequillworker-line-4 = Ask Aveline about destinations; I just keep the charts straight.

wh40k-footfall-ambient-omicronkhepraworker-line-1 = The machine is listening. Speak respectfully.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-omicronkhepraworker-line-2 = One loose coupling, six hours of prayer and paperwork.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-omicronkhepraworker-line-3 = I prefer a clean hum to a heroic repair.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-omicronkhepraworker-line-4 = Khepra handles work orders. I tend the bench.

wh40k-footfall-ambient-seraholtworker-line-1 = Sit down if you are dizzy. Pride can wait.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-seraholtworker-line-2 = Clean bandages first, stories afterwards.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-seraholtworker-line-3 = Tea is not a treatment. Still, it helps the night shift.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-seraholtworker-line-4 = Sera handles intake. Please leave the corridor clear.

wh40k-footfall-ambient-lucanrhoworker-line-1 = Keep the doorway clear. That is all I am asking.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-lucanrhoworker-line-2 = A quiet shift is not a wasted shift.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-lucanrhoworker-line-3 = Read the statement before you sign it.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-lucanrhoworker-line-4 = Casework goes to Hawkins. I can take papers; assignments come from the chief.

wh40k-footfall-ambient-ysabelkordworker-line-1 = I would not repeat that rumour in this office.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-ysabelkordworker-line-2 = The seals stay intact. Even when the queue grows.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-ysabelkordworker-line-3 = Some files are easier to carry than to read.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-ysabelkordworker-line-4 = Ysabel decides which questions matter. I cannot speak for her.

wh40k-footfall-ambient-fiotarsisworker-line-1 = Please do not fold the corners. These pages have survived enough.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-fiotarsisworker-line-2 = I know it looks like dust. There is a century under it.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-fiotarsisworker-line-3 = We found the missing index. It was filed under missing indices.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-fiotarsisworker-line-4 = Fio handles research requests; I can only point you to the desk.

wh40k-footfall-ambient-mirensolworker-line-1 = Wait for the confirmation tone. Silence is not a receipt.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-mirensolworker-line-2 = That was interference. I hope.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-mirensolworker-line-3 = A clear transmission makes this shift feel shorter.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-mirensolworker-line-4 = Miren handles the difficult signals. Mine are mostly delivery slips.

wh40k-footfall-ambient-aulusrennworker-line-1 = The reception list has changed again. Naturally.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-aulusrennworker-line-2 = A neat seal makes a poor message look respectable.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-aulusrennworker-line-3 = Protocol is easier when everyone has had breakfast.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-aulusrennworker-line-4 = Aulus receives petitions. I keep the appointments.

wh40k-footfall-ambient-censerworker-line-1 = The delegation requests precision, even in the waiting room.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-censerworker-line-2 = The incense is for the apparatus. Mostly.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-censerworker-line-3 = I checked the seals twice. It made the third check faster.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-censerworker-line-4 = Censer speaks for the delegation. I do not.

wh40k-footfall-ambient-caldusmireworker-line-1 = Smile before you mention the tariff. It sometimes helps.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-caldusmireworker-line-2 = A delegation travels with more luggage than a regiment.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-caldusmireworker-line-3 = Good manners cost less than replacing a door.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-caldusmireworker-line-4 = Caldus handles introductions and purchases. I arrange the chairs.

wh40k-footfall-ambient-atheliavossworker-line-1 = There is room to sit. You need not stand through every worry.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-atheliavossworker-line-2 = A candle is small work, but it is still work.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-atheliavossworker-line-3 = Faith does not make a tired person less tired. Let them rest.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-atheliavossworker-line-4 = Athelia will hear you. I can keep the waiting place quiet.

wh40k-footfall-ambient-garrickmornworker-line-1 = Brush the dust off the sample before you label it.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-garrickmornworker-line-2 = If the shaft starts talking back, leave the shaft.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-garrickmornworker-line-3 = A safe return is worth more than one extra crate.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-garrickmornworker-line-4 = Garrick takes the work requests. I just count the samples.

wh40k-footfall-ambient-resident-line-1 = There is always another ship. I keep telling myself that.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-resident-line-2 = A warm meal and a dry bunk. That is my plan for today.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-resident-line-3 = The market feels different after a long voyage.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-resident-line-4 = Looking for proper work? Ask at the service counters.

wh40k-footfall-ambient-seeker-line-1 = I check my kit twice. Experience is expensive.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-seeker-line-2 = Next voyage I am taking fewer promises and more supplies.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-seeker-line-3 = The docks are where every grand plan meets a timetable.
wh40k-footfall-ambient-seeker-line-4 = I am waiting for a berth, not recruiting a crew today.

wh40k-footfall-ambient-marker-desc = Spawns one protected ambient NPC with a generated human name. Place the marker, not the runtime body.
